<title>JAPAN: Marktec - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Marktec - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.54		vs	    1.72</p>
<p> Operating	  183    million	  vs	  175    million</p>
<p> Current	    196    million	  vs	  207    million</p>
<p> Net		  106    million	  vs	  111    million</p>
